Description: GitHub Actions self-hosted runner desktop monitor
 Runner Monitor shows runner connectivity, busy state, active workflow jobs,
 session history and local runner service health. Packaged Linux builds use
 a native C bridge linked to pinned Infiltratr Common for canonical theme
 roles and durable atomic configuration/history publication.
